   "conversationId": "2099832441456193634",
   "text": "Beautifully written. I’ve been in the fight for 30 years.  I’ve seen this rotten industry from the hospital side, the physician group side, the insurance side and the TPA side before starting my own TPA 22 years ago.  That’s when the fight against the system started.  In 2016, my world changed.  The last 10 years have changed from a fight for a reason to a fight for a purpose and I’ll bust hell wide open before I sit idly by and watch this system destroy companies and lives.",
