   "conversationId": "2099294239364358377",
   "text": "Here’s your reward for building a successful business:\n\nHealthcare fiduciary liability.\n\nYou’re expected to police claims, contracts, fees and vendors in an industry you were never trained to understand.\n\nMeanwhile, many of the “experts” you hire expressly disclaim fiduciary responsibility.\n\nYou get the liability.\n\nThey get the enormous fees.\n\nMake it make sense.  You can't.",
   "lang": "en",
