   "conversationId": "2098441196469199060",
   "text": "MEWAs have way too many government regulations and oversight.  Great concept but a living hell to get approved.  I love all alternatives to traditional healthcare but our federal government won’t allow ICHRA money to pay for anything but exchange plans and, if you can find one, an individual plan. Big insurance, pharma and hospitals control Congress. Until that stops, we will continue to figure it out ourselves.",
