   "conversationId": "2098440695631495356",
   "text": "PRICE GOUGING\n\nDuring COVID, the government called out price gouging on toilet paper, hand sanitizer and other essentials.\n\nGas shortage? Price gouging.\n\nNatural disaster? Price gouging.\n\nBut hospitals can charge outrageous prices every single day of every year and somehow we don’t use the same language.\n\nGovernment calls out price gouging everywhere else.\n\nHealthcare?  Crickets.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-11T15:57:03.000Z",
